(text ".meas tran ya0 find v(/OUT_A) at=1.95u\n.meas tran ya1 find v(/OUT_A) at=3.95u\n.meas tran ya2 find v(/OUT_A) at=5.95u\n.meas tran ya3 find v(/OUT_A) at=7.95u\n.meas tran ya4 find v(/OUT_A) at=9.95u\n.meas tran yb0 find v(/OUT_B) at=1.95u\n.meas tran yb1 find v(/OUT_B) at=3.95u\n.meas tran yb2 find v(/OUT_B) at=5.95u\n.meas tran yb3 find v(/OUT_B) at=7.95u\n.meas tran yb4 find v(/OUT_B) at=9.95u\n.meas tran lvh find v(/IN_A) at=3.95u\n.meas tran lvl find v(/IN_A) at=1.95u\n.meas tran ylh find v(/OUT_A_LV) at=1.95u\n.meas tran yll find v(/OUT_A_LV) at=3.95u\n.meas tran amin min v(/IN_A) from=0.5u to=10u\n.meas tran bmin min v(/IN_B) from=0.5u to=10u\n.meas tran ymin min v(/OUT_A_LV) from=0.5u to=10u\n.meas tran tphl_a trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u targ v(/OUT_A) val=100 fall=1 td=1.9u\n.meas tran tplh_a trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 fall=1 td=5.9u targ v(/OUT_A) val=100 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran tphl_b trig v(/IN_B) val=-5 rise=1 td=3.9u targ v(/OUT_B) val=100 fall=1 td=3.9u\n.meas tran tplh_b trig v(/IN_B) val=-5 fall=1 td=7.9u targ v(/OUT_B) val=100 rise=1 td=7.9u\n.meas tran lv_hl trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u targ v(/OUT_A_LV) val=-5 fall=1 td=1.9u\n.meas tran lv_lh trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 fall=1 td=5.9u targ v(/OUT_A_LV) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran xlo_min min v(/OUT_A) from=4u to=5u\n.meas tran xlo_max max v(/OUT_B) from=6u to=7u\n.meas tran xhi_min min v(/OUT_A) from=8u to=9u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7dc694c-bdd7-4252-82ee-92b0e774e20d"))
(text "NOT_N16 testbench. 2 us per input state, DUT (A,B) = 00 10 11 01 00: each half switches while the other is static.\nSTIM_x (HV, ideal) -> divider -> driver inverter (DRV) -> divider -> IN_x (LV): real edges and levels on the DUT grids.\nOUT_x (HV) -> one divider (C1 = 3.9 pF x 10 grids) -> OUT_x_LV -> 5 load tubes, both inverters on the net = fanout 10.\nPlot V(/IN_A) V(/IN_B) V(/OUT_A) V(/OUT_B) V(/OUT_A_LV); .meas: ya0..4 / yb0..4 = OUT_A / OUT_B at the end of each state,\nxlo_min / xlo_max / xhi_min = the static output while the other half switches (plate-to-plate capacitance)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6bb1219f-bb21-4fb6-9f6b-e6c2a4428ee4"))
